ives, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{xx}(x,y) & =-\\frac{1}{(x-y+1)^{2}}, & \\,{f}_{xx}(0,0) & =-1 \\\\ {f}_{xy}(x,y) & =\\frac{1}{(x-y+1)^{2}}, & \\,{f}_{xy}(0,0) & =1 \\\\ {f}_{yy}(x,y) & =-\\frac{1}{(x-y+1)^{2}}, & \\,{f}_{yy}(0,0) & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the second-degree Taylor polynomial is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & ≈0+1\\cdot x+(-1)\\cdot y+\\frac{1}{2}(-1\\cdot {x}^{2}+2(1)\\cdot xy+(-1)\\cdot {y}^{2}) \\\\  & =1x-y-\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}+1xy+(-\\frac{1}{2}){y}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\na+b+c=1+1+(-\\frac{1}{2})=\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378946 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378947 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378948 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378949 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378950 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1041 "selection" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378948 13194139536000 true] [17592186378945 1110 #uuid "39951829-8446-5d44-9a66-10d2a5dffa82" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378946 1034 "3" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378946 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536000 true] [17592186378946 1111 #uuid "2a94be21-1570-5af0-8dd8-59bd07104982" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378947 1034 "2" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378947 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536000 true] [17592186378947 1111 #uuid "e1c0697a-9a0d-5886-9e09-0567d709f8db" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378948 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378948 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536000 true] [17592186378948 1111 #uuid "5ab8839d-1cdb-541f-b23d-b3e16b281944" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378949 1034 "\\frac{5}{4}" 13194139536000 true] [17592186378949 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536000 true] [17592186378949 1111 #uuid "0870d895-5